  "paper_id": "ccs-2025-phalanx-an-fhe-friendly-snark-for-verifiable-computation-73cae8e7",
  "title": "Phalanx: An FHE-Friendly SNARK for Verifiable Computation on Encrypted Data",
  "abstract": "Verifiable Computation over encrypted data (VCoed) has two popular paradigms: SNARK-FHE (applying SNARKs to prove FHE operations) and FHE-SNARK (homomorphically evaluating SNARK proofs). For the existing works, FHE-SNARK has a much better efficiency compared to SNARK-FHE.",
